(181175, 10384, 3032, '<td valign="top">The color cast (purpleblue) is very distracting. I guess it is the color of the flash (big hard shadows) fooling the white balance. Best to set a manual whitebalance, also to compensate for indoor lighting+flash combinations.<br/>It would have been nice to see a face with a hand, now it is a big hand with a hidden face.</td>', 'The color cast (purpleblue) is very distracting. I guess it is the color of the flash (big hard shadows) fooling the white balance. Best to set a manual whitebalance, also to compensate for indoor lighting+flash combinations.It would have been nice to see a face with a hand, now it is a big hand with a hidden face.', '2003-01-02 05:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(181176, 10416, 3032, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, light and detail.<br/>The best solution to quit smoking is to never start with it I think. :-)<br/>(I don''t smoke)</td>', 'Like the composition, light and detail.The best solution to quit smoking is to never start with it I think. :-)(I don''t smoke)', '2003-01-02 05:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
