(181947, 10399, 4085, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it better if there were only 2 glasses in the picture.  It would look less crowded to me. Good shot.</td>', 'I think I would have liked it better if there were only 2 glasses in the picture.  It would look less crowded to me. Good shot.', '2003-01-03 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
