(181955, 10436, 714, '<td valign="top">This is almost a perfect shot.  There are some light spots on the church above the window.   I hope you don''t get hammered for being different.</td>', 'This is almost a perfect shot.  There are some light spots on the church above the window.   I hope you don''t get hammered for being different.', '2003-01-03 15:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(181957, 10381, 4085, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would have cropped it differently.</td>', 'Nice, but I would have cropped it differently.', '2003-01-03 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(182036, 10381, 5979, '<td valign="top">great fire work capture....</td>', 'great fire work capture....', '2003-01-03 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(182145, 10436, 5313, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo!  And what a wonderful way to bring in the New Year--by attending the Watch Night Service!  What a great job!</td>', 'Awesome photo!  And what a wonderful way to bring in the New Year--by attending the Watch Night Service!  What a great job!', '2003-01-04 01:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(182146, 10408, 5313, '<td valign="top">What a good idea!</td>', 'What a good idea!', '2003-01-04 02:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(182155, 10436, 4648, '<td valign="top">Hope you mean you spent it here.  This is beautiful.  I''m glad you left the unlit part on.  That adds so much to it.  There''s not a thing wrong with this that I can find, and I''ve looked hard.  I really like the frame, and I usually don''t care for them.  Fantastic job.  I''d give it a 10 if I could.  PTL</td>', 'Hope you mean you spent it here.  This is beautiful.  I''m glad you left the unlit part on.  That adds so much to it.  There''s not a thing wrong with this that I can find, and I''ve looked hard.  I really like the frame, and I usually don''t care for them.  Fantastic job.  I''d give it a 10 if I could.  PTL', '2003-01-04 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(182156, 10388, 4648, '<td valign="top">A very good photo.  And it will be broken!  This is really.  Hope you don''t get beat up about "feet".  I like this shot.  I''d give it an 8.  PTL</td>', 'A very good photo.  And it will be broken!  This is really.  Hope you don''t get beat up about "feet".  I like this shot.  I''d give it an 8.  PTL', '2003-01-04 03:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(182157, 10416, 4648, '<td valign="top">I hope you succeed.  Here''s wishing you the best and congratulations on a fantastic photo.  This, in my opinion, is very good.  I especially like the light on the sloping part of the cigarette.  You put thought into this.  It deserves a 7. PTL</td>', 'I hope you succeed.  Here''s wishing you the best and congratulations on a fantastic photo.  This, in my opinion, is very good.  I especially like the light on the sloping part of the cigarette.  You put thought into this.  It deserves a 7. PTL', '2003-01-04 03:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(182158, 10394, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really good shot.  Hope you succeed.  This is seriously a good shot.  Focus, composition, croping, light - all good.  Worth an 8.  PLT&gt;</td>', 'Really good shot.  Hope you succeed.  This is seriously a good shot.  Focus, composition, croping, light - all good.  Worth an 8.  PLT>', '2003-01-04 03:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(182160, 10408, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a very clear, sharp shot.  A very good photo and a very good idea.  I hope you succeed.  I like the way you angled it just a little.  Wish you hadn''t cropped off the corner.  But that didn''t hurt it that much. Personally I''m a NASB person.   I''d give it an 8.  PTL<br/></td>', 'This is a very clear, sharp shot.  A very good photo and a very good idea.  I hope you succeed.  I like the way you angled it just a little.  Wish you hadn''t cropped off the corner.  But that didn''t hurt it that much. Personally I''m a NASB person.   I''d give it an 8.  PTL', '2003-01-04 03:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(182161, 10353, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.  I love what looks like a hat, in the box.  I''m assuming the title is a happy new year wish.  This is worthy of an 8.  PTL</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.  I love what looks like a hat, in the box.  I''m assuming the title is a happy new year wish.  This is worthy of an 8.  PTL', '2003-01-04 03:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(182162, 10417, 4648, '<td valign="top">Been living in the south for 33 years and still can''t eat these things.  Give me pinto or navy beans anytime.  But they look good in this photo.  You did a good job on this one.  They look cooked to perfection also, some just busting open.  We cook a silver coin, wrapped in tin foil, in with them - something about lots of money.  I''d give you a 7 for the photo, but not one red cent for the beans.  PTL.</td>', 'Been living in the south for 33 years and still can''t eat these things.  Give me pinto or navy beans anytime.  But they look good in this photo.  You did a good job on this one.  They look cooked to perfection also, some just busting open.  We cook a silver coin, wrapped in tin foil, in with them - something about lots of money.  I''d give you a 7 for the photo, but not one red cent for the beans.  PTL.', '2003-01-04 03:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(182163, 10403, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is that why it"s out of focus.  Can''t pull that one over on me.  What''s your excuse on your other photos.  Cute idea but don''t ruin a beautiful baby photo.  I love the baby but would give the photo a aaaaaaaaaaa3.  PTL</td>', 'Is that why it"s out of focus.  Can''t pull that one over on me.  What''s your excuse on your other photos.  Cute idea but don''t ruin a beautiful baby photo.  I love the baby but would give the photo a aaaaaaaaaaa3.  PTL', '2003-01-04 03:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(182184, 10353, 773, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The colors and composition are beautiful.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The colors and composition are beautiful.', '2003-01-04 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(182185, 10379, 773, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  I love the colors and the trails the fireworks leave.  The smoke has a nice effect too.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  I love the colors and the trails the fireworks leave.  The smoke has a nice effect too.', '2003-01-04 08:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(182186, 10358, 773, '<td valign="top">This is a simple, but beautiful shot.  I love the lighting!</td>', 'This is a simple, but beautiful shot.  I love the lighting!', '2003-01-04 08:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(182187, 10400, 773, '<td valign="top">I love the way you captured the fireworks framing the top of the needle.  The fireworks follow the same shape and lines as the needle, and makes for a great composition.</td>', 'I love the way you captured the fireworks framing the top of the needle.  The fireworks follow the same shape and lines as the needle, and makes for a great composition.', '2003-01-04 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(182188, 10373, 773, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  This was an idea that I had, but I didn''t know how to do it.  You have done it well.  Congratulationsl.  I wish the colors were a little brighter though.</td>', 'Nicely done.  This was an idea that I had, but I didn''t know how to do it.  You have done it well.  Congratulationsl.  I wish the colors were a little brighter though.', '2003-01-04 08:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(182190, 10412, 773, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2003-01-04 08:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(182191, 10416, 773, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  The lighting on the left is too harsh for my personal taste, but it is a great image.</td>', 'Excellent composition!  The lighting on the left is too harsh for my personal taste, but it is a great image.', '2003-01-04 08:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
