(185693, 10416, 5515, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted on this image. I am new here and this is a real welcome surprise. I decided to come here because of the quality of images and the unbiased approach of the voting. IMO this is the best online contest out there. <br/> <br/>Thanks to management and all of you.</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted on this image. I am new here and this is a real welcome surprise. I decided to come here because of the quality of images and the unbiased approach of the voting. IMO this is the best online contest out there.  Thanks to management and all of you.', '2003-01-08 09:10:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(185706, 10384, 4615, '<td valign="top">On coming dead last:<br/>Looking at the three absolute clichés that took the three ribbons, I actually don''t feel so bad.  I really like my picture and consider it a 10 regardless.  The focus is perfect.  (Funny how no one mentioned that) The colors are bold and rich; the garish light on her hand accurately portrays the moment.  Most of all I can say without fear of being shot down, that this was an original idea.  I didn''t get this out of a photography manual, there weren''t eight other people doing basically the same thing, you don''t see it repeated everywhere.  Who knows maybe one day you will.<br/>  Am I being arrogant, ungracious?  Probably.  But it''s between that and caving into to someone else''s vision, and I wont do that.</td>', 'On coming dead last:Looking at the three absolute clichés that took the three ribbons, I actually don''t feel so bad.  I really like my picture and consider it a 10 regardless.  The focus is perfect.  (Funny how no one mentioned that) The colors are bold and rich; the garish light on her hand accurately portrays the moment.  Most of all I can say without fear of being shot down, that this was an original idea.  I didn''t get this out of a photography manual, there weren''t eight other people doing basically the same thing, you don''t see it repeated everywhere.  Who knows maybe one day you will.  Am I being arrogant, ungracious?  Probably.  But it''s between that and caving into to someone else''s vision, and I wont do that.', '2003-01-08 09:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
