(185733, 10422, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love this shot -- definitely deserving of a win!  After looking at it for the 10th time or so, I had one idea that might have been an interesting twist for this one.  What if the two classes had been tipped toward each other?  That would have given the illusion that the two glasses came together, creating the sparks by their impact.  Just a thought.  Congrats on a unique, fun image!</td>', 'I love this shot -- definitely deserving of a win!  After looking at it for the 10th time or so, I had one idea that might have been an interesting twist for this one.  What if the two classes had been tipped toward each other?  That would have given the illusion that the two glasses came together, creating the sparks by their impact.  Just a thought.  Congrats on a unique, fun image!', '2003-01-08 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(185749, 10413, 5515, '<td valign="top">How in the world is this image a 1,2,3 or 4???? Some people saw there images getting killed and voted others low. They sure weren''t voting on the merit of the image. 5 is average, to rate this below average is unfair. <br/> <br/>Don''t know if I agree on the whole bodily waste thing. LOL.. This is a fine image... <br/> <br/>Dave</td>', 'How in the world is this image a 1,2,3 or 4???? Some people saw there images getting killed and voted others low. They sure weren''t voting on the merit of the image. 5 is average, to rate this below average is unfair.  Don''t know if I agree on the whole bodily waste thing. LOL.. This is a fine image...  Dave', '2003-01-08 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
