(185768, 10414, 714, '<td valign="top">Thanks Karen <br/>This is a non-alcohol drink.  When I went to partys as a youngster.  I remember them being busy and colorful and people spilling drinks.  Very kaotic.  I tried to add that to the photo.  My son and I had fun taking this.  I don''t think he will ever drink the sparkling strawberry cidar again.  We took at least 40 pictures. And he had to keep drinking them, so we could pour more.  Thank goodness they were small 2 inch glasses.</td>', 'Thanks Karen This is a non-alcohol drink.  When I went to partys as a youngster.  I remember them being busy and colorful and people spilling drinks.  Very kaotic.  I tried to add that to the photo.  My son and I had fun taking this.  I don''t think he will ever drink the sparkling strawberry cidar again.  We took at least 40 pictures. And he had to keep drinking them, so we could pour more.  Thank goodness they were small 2 inch glasses.', '2003-01-08 11:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
