(186370, 10397, 5508, '<td valign="top">I like this image, to bad it came pretty low in the rankings.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-01-09 14:04:04.</i></td>', 'I like this image, to bad it came pretty low in the rankings.', '2003-01-09 14:03:35.000000', '2003-01-09 14:04:04.000000', 0),
(186490, 10396, 3032, '<td valign="top">Whoohaaaaaaaaaaa!<br/>Great &amp; nice comments, a good position and a nice score. Made my week. :) <br/> <br/>I tried it on its side, both the bottle and the cork, but it didn''t look good enough to my taste. Also tried a black background, didn''t look good with the bottle.<br/> <br/>I hoped it would go for third, the score was up to 6.6 at one time, but suddenly it dropped to near 6.3.... Ah well, better luck next time, I wan''t a ribbon within 5 years! :)</td>', 'Whoohaaaaaaaaaaa!Great & nice comments, a good position and a nice score. Made my week. :)  I tried it on its side, both the bottle and the cork, but it didn''t look good enough to my taste. Also tried a black background, didn''t look good with the bottle. I hoped it would go for third, the score was up to 6.6 at one time, but suddenly it dropped to near 6.3.... Ah well, better luck next time, I wan''t a ribbon within 5 years! :)', '2003-01-09 16:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
